2Ch 21:1 , Jehoram, succeeding Jehoshaphat, slays his brethren;
2Ch 21:5 , His wicked reign;
2Ch 21:8 , Edom and Libnah revolt;
2Ch 21:12 , The prophecy of Elijah against him in writing;
2Ch 21:16 , Philistines and Arabians oppress him;
2Ch 21:18 , His incurable disease, infamous death, and burial.
